TRAIT — provenance of everything in this package that came from somewhere else
==============================================================================

Recorded 2026-08-31; revised 2026-09-02, when the one-token administration was
withdrawn (section 1a). Nothing in this directory is a copy of the dataset; the
items are fetched at run time and verified. Nothing in it is a copy of upstream
code either, as of the revision: the paper's three prompt templates and its
scoring arithmetic left with the administration that used them.


